		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>This daemon manifests as a sallow child with a bloody, slit throat. Born of betrayal, often the murder of children.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 14, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 dagger +3 (1d4 + bleed), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bleed</strong>. 1d4 damage each round. CON 12+, stabilize check, or healing to staunch.</p><p></p><p><strong>Doom Aura</strong>. All mortals within near, CHA 12+ or filled with terror. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
